---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Shipping | The Royal House of Engagement" description="How Low Value Content shirts are made, what shipping costs, and where we ship.">
  <article class="plain-page">
    <header><p class="eyebrow">Draft · November 23, 2026</p><h1>Shipping.</h1><p>Every shirt is printed to order and shipped directly to you.</p></header>
    <div class="rows">
    <section><h2>Where we ship</h2><p>United States addresses only, for now.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Cost</h2><p>US shipping is $5.99 per order. Any sales tax is calculated and shown at secure checkout before you pay.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Made to order</h2><p>Nothing sits in a warehouse waiting for you. Your shirt is printed after you order, by our print partner, and then shipped. Production and delivery times vary with demand and carrier conditions, so any date shown is an estimate, not a guarantee.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Tracking</h2><p>When your order ships, your order status page shows its progress and carrier tracking. Keep the order link from your confirmation.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Wrong address</h2><p>Check the address at checkout. Write to <a href="mailto:support@lowvaluecontent.com">support@lowvaluecontent.com</a> quickly if it is wrong; once a shirt is in production we may not be able to change it.</p></section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
